# Deploy artifacts: the live demo builds from the repo alone, so the runtime
# inputs the ML-Ops console needs are tracked (windows.parquet via LFS) and the
# 40 curated demo cases live in deploy/demo_cache/ rather than the dev cache.
!results/eligible_cases.csv
!results/windows.parquet
!deploy/demo_cache/*.parquet
